{"id":"word:hebrew:H7992","type":"word","title":"שְׁלִישִׁי","subtitle":"H7992 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"third ; feminine a third (part); by extension, a third (day, year or time); specifically, a third-story cell)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שְׁלִישִׁי (H7992) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: a.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 108 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שְׁלִישִׁי (shᵉlîyshîy) means third ; feminine a third (part); by extension, a third (day, year or time); specifically, a third-story cell) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 2 13."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שְׁלִישִׁי","transliteration":"shᵉlîyshîy","pronunciation":"shel-ee-shee'","strong":"H7992","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7992","partOfSpeech":"a","forms":["הַ/שְּׁלִישִׁ֔י","הַ/שְּׁלִישִׁ֑י","הַ/שְּׁלִישִׁ֗י","הַ/שְּׁלִישִׁי֙","הַ/שְּׁלִישִׁ֜י"],"morphs":[["HTd/Aomsa",58],["HTd/Aofsa",9],["HC/Td/Ncfsa",8],["HTd/Ncfsa",5],["HC/Td/Aofsa",4],["HAofsa",4],["HC/Td/Aomsa",3],["HAompa",2],["HAomsa",2],["HC/Aompa",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"third ; feminine a third (part); by extension, a third (day, year or time); specifically, a third-story cell)","usage":"third (part, rank, time), three (years old).","full":"H7992. shelishi שְׁלִישִׁי masculine שְׁלִישִׁית feminine adjective ordinal number 108 third ; — שְׁלִישִׁי יוֺם Gen 1:13 31 t., etc. (64 t., rarely שְׁלִשִׁי ); plural שְׁלִשִׁים ( third 50, set of messengers, etc.) 1Sam 19:21 ; 2Kin 1:13 4 t.; הַשְּׁלִישִׁית בַּשָּׁנָה 1Kin 18:1 4 t., etc. (33 t.; sometimes שְׁלִשִׁת שְׁלִשִׁית, , etc.); = third part, a third 2Sam 18:2 (3 t. in verse) + 13 t., + (construct) Num 15:6 4 t., + שְׁלִשִׁתֵיךְ (Ges § 91l ) Ezek 5:12 third part of thee; = third time 1Sam 3:8 ; also שְׁלִישִׁיָּה Isa 19:24 third (on par with other two); בַּשְּׁלִישִׁים Ezek 42:3 in the thirds , i.e. third story ; — שׁ ׳עֶגְלַת 15:5 ; Jer 48:34 , see ׳ע p. 722. — שְׁלִישִׁ֫תָה Ezek 21:19 is corrupt and doubtful; Krae proposes וְשֻׁלְּשָׁה the sword shall be doubled and trebled ; other conjectures in Co Toy. 1Sam 20:5 strike out ᵐ5 ׳הַשּׁ We Dr and others, so 20:12 . 2Sam 23:18 read ᵑ6 הַשְּׁלשִׁם We Dr and others","rootNote":"ordinal from 7969 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 2 13","keyReferences":["1Chr 2 13","1Chr 3 2","1Chr 3 15","1Chr 8 1","1Chr 8 39","1Chr 12 10","1Chr 23 19","1Chr 24 8"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":108,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 2 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁלִישִֽׁי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aomsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 3 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":3,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁלִשִׁי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aomsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 3 15","book":"1Chr","chapter":3,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁלִשִׁי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aomsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 8 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":8,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁלִישִֽׁי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aomsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 8 39","book":"1Chr","chapter":8,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁלִשִֽׁי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aomsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁלִשִֽׁי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aomsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 23 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁלִישִׁ֔י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aomsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 24 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":24,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁלִישִׁ֔י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aomsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 24 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":24,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁלִישִׁ֔י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aomsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 25 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":25,"verse":10,"engl